  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Add the dried and salted cod fillets and cook for 2 minutes on each side.",
    "Add the sweet chilli sauce, sea salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the chopped potatoes and carrots, and pour in the water.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
